From: Steve Grocott <sgrocott () macan ! com>
Date: Wed, 23 Dec 1998 17:37:03 +0000
To: tru64-unix-managers
Subject: Summary - what is dop?
X-MARC-Message: https://marc.info/?l=tru64-unix-managers&m=96078731112149
