I have a Decstation 3000 running DU4.0b, with an AdvFS domain spanning two
disks, rz1c and rz6c ( a 500MB micropolis and a 4G Seagate Barracuda, resp.).
The AdvFS domain has two filesystems, I believe matching the physical disk
boundaries.

A few days back, the AdvFS volumes seemed to have automatically dismounted,
and it looked lie one of the disks failed.  The error logs show lots of
errors of type:
ADdvFS I/O error:
	Volume /dev/rz1c
	...
	Type of operation: Read
	Error: 5
