here is one for the LSM gurus out there:

We had a system running DU4.0b that has been updated from DU3.2. To enlarge the existend / and /usr-Patritions, I booted from CD (4.0B), did the partitioning and restored the data. Then volencap was neccessary to put / and /usr under LSM again. 
Now the problem: 
We had a diskgroup (t20dg) based on some raidsets. With the enlarged filesystems I am not able to import that diskgroup. 

